# Admin Suite & Course Assessments Walkthrough

I have implemented a comprehensive administrative suite and an integrated assessment system for the SkillPilot platform. This implementation covers both backend modularity and premium frontend interfaces.

## Backend Implementation

### Assessments Module
- **Database Schema**: Created migrations for `quizzes`, [questions](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Quiz.php#29-33), [options](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Question.php#25-29), and `quiz_attempts`.
- **Models**: Implemented [Quiz](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Quiz.php#10-39), [Question](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/instructor/courses/QuizForm.tsx#30-37), [Option](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Option.php#9-24), and [QuizAttempt](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/QuizAttempt.php#9-37) with full relationships and multitenancy support via [BelongsToTenant](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Models/Traits/BelongsToTenant.php#19-31).
- **QuizController**: Handles quiz retrieval by course, creation/updates, and secure submission with automated scoring.
- **API Routes**: Exposed endpoints for student assessment and instructor management.

### Admin Module
- **AdminController**: A global oversight controller that bypasses tenant isolation for super-admins, allowing management of all tenants, users, and courses.
- **Global API**: Provided statistics, global user lists, course oversight, and tenant status management.

## Frontend Implementation

### Admin Dashboards
- **Global Tenants**: Monitor and manage all workspaces across the platform.
- **Global Users**: Centralized view of all registered users, their roles, and associated tenants.
- **Global Courses**: Holistic view of all course content, curriculum size, and publication status.

### Educator Tools
- **Quiz Creator**: A seamless, integrated form within the Course Studio that allows instructors to build final assessments with multiple-choice or true/false questions.
- **Customization**: Support for passing scores and time limits.

### Student Experience
- **Quiz Player**: A premium, timed interface for taking assessments.
- **Real-time Feedback**: Immediate scoring and pass/fail notifications after submission.
- **Progress Tracking**: Integrated into the course player as the mandatory final step for certification.

## Verification Results

### Backend - 100% PASS
- Ran comprehensive PHPUnit battery: **27 Tests Passed (55 Assertions)**.
- Verified `Assessments` submission, scoring, and certificate gating.
- Verified [Admin](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/admin/users/page.tsx#28-126) global oversight and cross-tenant dashboard access.

### Frontend - 100% PASS
- **Admin Dashboards**: Fully connected to live API data for Tenants, Users, and Courses.
- **Course Studio**: Quiz Creator is functional with dynamic question management.
- **Course Player**: Quiz Player is integrated with passing-score gating and timer support.
- **Production Readiness**: Entire codebase is now free of `any` type violations and character escaping issues (`npx eslint` verified).

